# The build context is the repository root. Everything in it is left out, and only what
# the image needs is let back in: pyproject.toml and README.md (the metadata of the
# package), the code, the SQL, the configurations, the experiment scripts and the files
# of docker/. Generated data, virtual environments, git, credentials such as .env, editor
# files, tests, documentation and caches never reach the builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!sql/
!configs/
!experiments/
!docker/

# Left out again inside the directories let in above: bytecode and build metadata that a
# local interpreter wrote next to the sources.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
